description "New Republic Trooper

The bread-and-butter good guys.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Shock Baton (Yellow/Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Staggers on hit
-- 10% more knockback
-- 50% shorter
-- 33% thicker
- DL-44 Heavy Blaster Pistol (2)
- DH-17 Blaster Rifle (3)
- Class B Frag Grenade (1)
-- 28% smaller splash
-- Primary fire only
- V-59 Conc Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- Close Combat Training (1)
- Assemble (3)"
